  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "Aj+BgmSavDL45yZ2mDT+BMuoLos=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:16.218Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Systematic is an Aarhus firm with deep defence and healthcare capability, and its record notes it owns products in both. Depth in two sovereignty-exposed verticals is the qualifying half of that; owning the products in them is the disqualifying half.\n\nDefence and healthcare are where verifiable, controlled records matter most, so the vertical exposure points the right way. But a product owner in those verticals already occupies the application layer, which places Systematic in the same category as the other product-owning leads in this set. Its open-source posture was not researched, and it sits at priority 4.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**4 \u00b7 needs OSS screen**\n- Systematic (DK)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Aarhus. Deep defence and healthcare.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:30:16.218140Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:16.218145Z"
    }
  },
